title: Accents, an emoji and CJK are typed, deleted and saved without corrupting the UTF-8 file
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
expect-file: edit-odd/unicode.md :: (?-i)\A## Título con ñ y €\n\nLínea con emoji 🙂ñ y 日本語終。\n\z

wait 3000
edit unicode.md 3 18
type ñ
key end
key backspace
type 終。
edit unicode.md 1 1
key delete
type ##
wait 300
mark unicode
wait 400
key save
wait 600
quit
